{"id":"4dff78b6-80cd-4ee2-9efb-992a20269f41","createdAt":"2026-10-27T05:08:59.969Z","batchId":"settings_glm-5-3-flash-gateway_low","approach":"html","modelId":"glm-5.3-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"settings","prompt":"An account settings panel with profile, notifications and privacy sections.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\" style=\"max-width:880px;width:100%\">\n\n    <div>\n      <h1>Account settings</h1>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Manage your profile, how we contact you, and who can see what.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\" role=\"tablist\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" data-tab=\"profile\">Profile</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\" data-tab=\"notifications\">Notifications</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\" data-tab=\"privacy\">Privacy</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- PROFILE -->\n    <section class=\"stack gap-lg\" id=\"tab-profile\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Profile</div>\n        <div class=\"card-desc\">This information appears on your public profile and next to your comments.</div>\n        <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-lg\">\n          <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"width:72px;height:72px;font-size:28px;background:#7c3aed;color:#fff\">MK</div>\n          <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n            <div><strong>Maya Kowalski</strong> <span class=\"badge\">Pro plan</span> <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Verified</span></div>\n            <div class=\"muted small\">Member since March 2021 · Last login today, 09:42 CET</div>\n            <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n              <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-secondary\">Upload new photo</button>\n              <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-ghost\">Remove</button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Personal details</div>\n        <div class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\">\n          <label>First name<input type=\"text\" value=\"Maya\"></label>\n          <label>Last name<input type=\"text\" value=\"Kowalski\"></label>\n          <label>Email address<input type=\"email\" value=\"maya.kowalski@example.com\"></label>\n          <label>Phone<input type=\"tel\" value=\"+48 601 234 567\"></label>\n          <label>Job title<input type=\"text\" value=\"Product Designer\"></label>\n          <label>Timezone\n            <select><option>Europe/Warsaw (UTC+1)</option><option>UTC</option><option>America/New_York (UTC−5)</option></select>\n          </label>\n          <label style=\"grid-column:1/-1\">Bio<textarea rows=\"3\">Product designer focused on accessibility and design systems. Occasionally writes about typography.</textarea></label>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n        <div class=\"row between\">\n          <span class=\"muted small\">Changes are saved to your account immediately.</span>\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n            <button class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Discard</button>\n            <button class=\"btn\">Save changes</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Password & security</div>\n        <div class=\"card-desc\">Password last changed 4 months ago.</div>\n        <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <div class=\"row between\"><span>Two-factor authentication</span><span class=\"badge\">Enabled</span></div>\n          <div class=\"row between\"><span>Active sessions</span><span class=\"muted small\">3 devices · <a href=\"#\">Review sessions</a></span></div>\n          <div class=\"row between\"><span>Login alerts</span><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">On</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\">Change password</button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- NOTIFICATIONS -->\n    <section class=\"stack gap-lg\" id=\"tab-notifications\" style=\"display:none\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Email notifications</div>\n        <div class=\"card-desc\">Choose which emails we send you. Transactional emails like receipts are always sent.</div>\n        <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Product updates — new features and improvements</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Weekly digest — a summary of your account activity</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Marketing — offers, events and surveys</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Security alerts — new sign-ins and password changes</label>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Push notifications</div>\n        <div class=\"card-desc\">Notifications are delivered to 2 devices: iPhone 15 and MacBook Pro.</div>\n        <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Comments and mentions</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Task assignments</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Direct messages</label>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n        <div class=\"row between\">\n          <span class=\"muted small\">Quiet hours: 22:00 – 07:00 (Europe/Warsaw)</span>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\">Edit quiet hours</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Notification volume (last 4 weeks)</div>\n        <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Notifications received per week\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":142},{\"label\":\"W2\",\"value\":118},{\"label\":\"W3\",\"value\":165},{\"label\":\"W4\",\"value\":97}]}'></div>\n        <div class=\"row between\">\n          <span class=\"muted small\">522 total · down 18% vs. previous period <span class=\"down\">▼ 18%</span></span>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-ghost\">Unsubscribe from all</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- PRIVACY -->\n    <section class=\"stack gap-lg\" id=\"tab-privacy\" style=\"display:none\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Visibility</div>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <label>Profile visibility\n            <select><option>Public — anyone can view</option><option selected>Team members only</option><option>Private — only me</option></select>\n          </label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Show my name on shared documents</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Show my email address on my public profile</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Allow search engines to index my profile</label>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Data & privacy</div>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <div class=\"row between\"><span>Personalised recommendations</span><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Enabled</span></div>\n          <div class=\"row between\"><span>Analytics sharing</span><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Opted out</span></div>\n          <div class=\"row between\"><span>Data export</span><button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\">Download my data</button></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"alert alert-destructive\">\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Danger zone</div>\n        <div class=\"card-desc\">Deleting your account removes all projects, comments and settings. This cannot be undone.</div>\n        <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-destructive\">Delete account</button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\ndocument.querySelectorAll('[data-tab]').forEach(function(btn){\n  btn.addEventListener('click', function(){\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-tab]').forEach(function(b){ b.className='btn btn-sm btn-outline'; });\n    btn.className='btn btn-sm';\n    ['profile','notifications','privacy'].forEach(function(t){\n      document.getElementById('tab-'+t).style.display = t===btn.dataset.tab ? '' : 'none';\n    });\n  });\n});\n</script>","deltas":[[3953,"<div"],[3953," class"],[3953,"=\""],[3953,"page"],[3953,"\">\n"],[3953," "],[3953," <"],[3953,"div"],[3953," class"],[3953,"=\""],[3953,"stack"],[3953," gap"],[3953,"-lg"],[3953,"\""],[3953," style"],[3953,"=\""],[3953,"max"],[3953,"-width"],[3953,":"],[3953,"8"],[3953,"80"],[3953,"px"],[3953,";width"],[3953,":"],[3953,"100"],[3953,"%"],[3953,"\">\n\n"],[3953,"   "],[3953," <"],[3953,"div"],[3953,">\n"],[3953,"     "],[3953," <"],[3953,"h"],[3953,"1"],[3953,">"],[3953,"Account"],[3953," settings"],[3953,"</h"],[3953,"1"],[3953,">\n"],[3953,"     "],[3953," <"],[3953,"p"],[3953," class"],[3953,"=\""],[3953,"m"],[3953,"uted"],[3953,"\">"],[3963,"Manage"],[3963," your"],[3963," profile"],[3963,","],[3963," how"],[3963," we"],[3963," contact"],[3963," you"],[3963,","],[3963," and"],[3963," who"],[3963," can"],[3963," see"],[3963," what"],[3963,".</"],[3963,"p"],[3963,">\n"],[3963,"   "],[3963," </"],[3963,"div"],[3963,">\n\n"],[3963,"   "],[3963," <"],[3963,"div"],[3963," class"],[3963,"=\"